## 🎯 Variables & Filters

@let project = "Markup+"
@let version = "0.6.0"

- Project: **{project}**
- Version: `{version}`
- Uppercase: **{project|upper}**
- Reversed: **{project|reverse}**

@if version == "0.6.0"
@success
You're using the latest version!
@end
